emarks"},{"id":"t-t-usq-transcript-2026-04-22","date":"2026-04-22","type":"remarks","title":"Q1 2026 Earnings Call: CEO Prepared Remarks","location":"investors.att.com","url":"https://investors.att.com/~/media/Files/A/ATT-IR-V2/financial-reports/quarterly-earnings/2026/1Q-2026/t-usq-transcript-2026-04-22.pdf","words":1337,"n_sentences":58,"year":"2026","s":["Thanks, Brett, and good morning, everyone.","We executed well in the first quarter, delivering results that were consistent with the outlook we provided, while implementing several key strategic initiatives.","We reported 584,000 total fiber and fixed wireless advanced Internet customer net additions.","During our Analyst and Investor Day in 2024, we shared a few data points highlighting the relative improvements that we see among our converged customers in key operating metrics such as customer lifetime values and churn.","We closed our transaction with Lumen, ahead of schedule, adding 1.1 million fiber customers, and over 4 million fiber locations.","Early indicators are positive.","We now offer fiber services throughout our distribution channels in these areas, which has driven sales activity well above pre-transaction trends.","We expanded the AT&T guarantee to cover internet Air and launched a new flagship app to deliver a simple digital-first experience to customers.","This is an advantage we're growing as we ramp our deployment at a faster pace than anyone else.","This positions AT&T to compete on performance and value by putting our service at the center of our converged offers and shifting the focus away from expensive device subsidies.","As we continue our journey forward, our strategies and capital allocation will remain focused on meeting the Advanced Connectivity needs of consumers, businesses, the public sector and first responders they adopt and rely on AI-enabled tools and applications.","We expect AI to fundamentally transform network requirements beyond download speeds to the ability to support symmetrical capacity, ultra-low latency and session control across multiple access technologies under sustained load.","With the opportunity to reach more end users than our competition, coupled with our historically scaled metro and long-haul core, AT&T is well positioned to lead our industry in AI-ready connectivity.","Investment in high-performing networking is a critical component of a competitive American AI ecosystem.","We continue to appreciate the leadership of SEC Chairman Carr in the commission's continued efforts to modernize America's networks."],"x":[0,62,34,12,1,1,3,7,9,9,10,10,11,12,14,14,1,56,35,14,0,2,3,3,4,7,9,9,10,10,10,10,11,12,2,36,28,12,3,3,4,6,8,9,9,10,10,12,12,12,3,37,26,11,7,7,7,9,11,11,11,12,12,14,14,4,39,31,12,1,1,2,3,3,4,6,7,8,10,11,14,5,33,27,5,4,9,10,13,14,6,31,25,7,1,3,3,6,12,13,14,7,20,16,6,3,7,7,8,13,13,8,17,14,4,2,4,4,6,9,16,15,2,8,9,10,19,16,5,7,8,9,9,12,11,17,13,2,1,3,12,19,17,4,1,4,12,12,13,10,9,3,8,12,13,14,8,8,1,4,15,13,12,3,3,8,10,16,9,9,2,10,12,17,12,10,3,3,4,7,18,7,7,0,19,8,8,0,20,13,13,3,7,9,12,21,14,12,3,9,10,10,22,7,4,0,23,5,5,1,9,24,12,10,2,2,7,25,6,6,2,2,10,26,9,8,1,2,27,11,11,0,28,8,8,1,12,29,3,3,1,9,30,5,5,1,11,31,10,9,1,1,32,8,8,2,8,12,33,7,7,2,2,3,34,3,3,1,6,35,3,3,1,12,36,5,5,1,10,37,9,8,1,8,38,3,2,0,39,3,3,0,40,7,7,1,6,41,6,4,2,4,4,42,6,6,2,3,9,43,5,5,0,44,5,5,0,45,4,4,1,11,46,6,6,1,5,47,2,2,0,48,12,11,3,1,7,10,49,3,3,1,6,50,5,5,0,51,3,3,0,52,5,5,4,10,11,12,13,53,5,5,0,54,3,3,1,2,55,3,3,0,56,6,6,1,9,57,5,5,0,58,4,4,0,59,3,3,2,10,14,60,5,4,1,4,61,4,4,1,9,62,4,4,1,3,63,2,2,0,64,3,3,0,65,2,2,0,66,5,4,1,12,67,1,1,0,68,2,2,0,69,3,3,0,70,2,2,1,4,71,1,1,1,7,72,3,3,0,73,3,3,1,3,74,2,2,1,8,75,3,3,1,6,76,2,2,0,77,1,1,1,13,78,3,3,0,79,4,4,1,12,80,2,2,0,81,3,3,1,13,82,2,2,1,6,83,3,3,0,84,2,2,0,85,3,3,0,86,3,3,0,87,4,4,1,8,88,2,2,0,89,4,4,1,3,90,2,2,1,6,91,1,1,0,92,3,3,0,93,2,2,0,95,3,3,1,6,96,1,1,0,97,4,4,1,12,98,3,3,1,9,99,2,2,0,100,3,3,1,11,102,2,2,1,10,103,3,3,0,104,1,1,1,10,105,1,1,0,106,3,3,1,2,107,3,3,0,108,1,1,0,109,2